{"id":"ca5c1762b574813b","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"Atomic Formula","display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["58-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(C,F,a_{\\mathrm{fn}},R,a_{\\mathrm{rel}})\">\\(S=(C,F,a_{\\mathrm{fn}},R,a_{\\mathrm{rel}})\\)</span> (一阶签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(S)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(S)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-项集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{fn}},F,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{rel}},R,\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{fn}},F,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{rel}},R,\\omega)\\)</span> (签名元数映射)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (由公式递归定义投影出的原子公式集算子)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{fn}},F,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{rel}},R,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(S)=\n\\{t_1\\doteq t_2:t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(S)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{P(\\vec t):P\\in R\\land\n\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(S)^{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{fn}},F,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_{\\mathrm{rel}},R,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(S)=\n\\{t_1\\doteq t_2:t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(S)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{P(\\vec t):P\\in R\\land\n\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(S)^{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(P)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(S)\\)</span> 是签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 下所有原子公式的集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1\\doteq t_2\">\\(t_1\\doteq t_2\\)</span> 是等式原子公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\vec t)\">\\(P(\\vec t)\\)</span> 是与关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的元数匹配的关系原子公式。</li>\n<li>原子公式是公式的基本构建块，不再包含逻辑连接词或量词</li>\n<li>在标准一阶逻辑中，原子公式只有两种：等式和关系符号应用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a> — 项</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"621985f38a386342\" href=\"?note=621985f38a386342\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-subformula.md\">../batch01/58-df-subformula.md</a> — 子公式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S=(C,F,a_{\\mathrm{fn}},R,a_{\\mathrm{rel}})$ (一阶签名, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(S)\\subseteq V$ ($S$-项集, see 